{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今日（19日）下午3時許，警方接獲報案，指藍田啟田道5號聖公會基孝中學有「尿袋」起火。消防及救護員到場，發現一名14歲男學生手指燙傷，他清醒由救護車送往聯合醫院治理。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.965319+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:06:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T12:17:16.080350+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:49.335061+00:00","content_hash":"cad0c9b948e66be72c785af43d25ed30c885c02c60eeaf925f32e242d1c15de9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.965319+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}